# ── keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# host.json and any agent key hold a PRIVATE Ed25519 seed in plaintext.
# Committing one hands over the identity permanently — there is no rotation
# and no revocation, because the key IS the account.
host.json
identity.json
agent.json
a[0-9].json
t_*.json
*.seed.json
*.pem
*.key

# ── runtime state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
state.json
feed.json
ringmaster.json
log.json
log-*.json
*.picks.json
*.tmp
.room
.hostdid

# ── build and scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.png
overlay-live.html
overlay-patched.html
overlay-test.html
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
